Relationship to PYNE
--------------------
PyneTS (`@hoox/pynets`) is the TypeScript / Bun counterpart of
**PYNE / pynescript**. Python `pynescript.runtime` is the source of
truth: when semantics disagree, Python wins.

The ANTLR4 grammars are **not** vendored here. `bun run generate` reads
`PinescriptLexer.g4` / `PinescriptParser.g4` from a sibling or parent
`hoox-sh/pyne` checkout (or `PYNESCRIPT_ROOT` / `PYNETS_GRAMMAR`).
Do not fork those `.g4` files into this repository.

In the PYNE repo this package is consumed only as the `pynets/` git
submodule.

